// LLAMP-SPEC v1 | ADR-020
=adr: 020
=title: Workflow Real-Time Auto-Trigger
=date: 2026-02-17
=status: accepted

#ctx
~problem: trigger nodes exist in engine but only fire via manual API invocation
~requirement: workflows must auto-execute when device states or alarms occur

#decision
=chosen: WorkflowTriggerDispatcher service (above DeviceStateService + WorkflowEngineService)
=methods: [dispatchDeviceStateChange(orgId, deviceId, field, value, stateData), dispatchAlarmTriggered(orgId, alarmData)]
=flow: DeviceState saved → Dispatcher.dispatchDeviceStateChange → WorkflowService.findTriggerWorkflows → WorkflowEngineService.execute (fire-and-forget)
=instantiation: once in server.ts, injected via fastify.decorate
=filter: matches on trigger node config.deviceId + config.field
=index: compound (orgId, isEnabled, triggerType)
!circular_dep: Dispatcher depends on WorkflowService + EngineService but NOT DeviceStateService
!fire_and_forget: device state save NOT blocked by workflow execution

#consequences
+pos: [core_automation_enabled, no_manual_execution_required, filter_precision, existing_engine_unchanged]
-neg: [DB_query_per_device_state_write, fire-forget_means_no_error_propagation]

#scope
=arch_summary_update: yes
